---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Peterborough By The Numbers · ElectionFest"
  description="ElectionFest kiosk for Peterborough By The Numbers."
  canonical="https://vote.ajshearer.com/data/kiosk"
>
  <main class="min-h-screen bg-[#651024] px-6 py-10 text-white md:flex md:items-center">
    <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl">
      <div class="text-center">
        <div class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[#f0cbd5]">Peterborough By The Numbers</div>
        <h1 class="mx-auto mt-5 max-w-5xl text-5xl font-black leading-[0.95] tracking-tight md:text-8xl">Pick a question.</h1>
        <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-white/75 md:text-2xl">Get the answer in under a minute. Every screen lets you dig into the full data if you want more.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-12 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
        <a href="/data/taxes" class="rounded-[2rem] bg-white p-7 text-[#3a1a22] shadow-xl transition hover:-translate-y-1 md:p-9"><div class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#651024]">01 · Taxes</div><div class="mt-4 text-3xl font-black">Why are taxes going up?</div><p class="mt-3 leading-6 text-[#7a6167]">See the major pressures and one-time offsets.</p></a>
        <a href="/data/spending" class="rounded-[2rem] bg-white p-7 text-[#3a1a22] shadow-xl transition hover:-translate-y-1 md:p-9"><div class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#651024]">02 · Spending</div><div class="mt-4 text-3xl font-black">Where is the money going?</div><p class="mt-3 leading-6 text-[#7a6167]">See the biggest comparable service changes.</p></a>
        <a href="/data/results" class="rounded-[2rem] bg-white p-7 text-[#3a1a22] shadow-xl transition hover:-translate-y-1 md:p-9"><div class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#651024]">03 · Results</div><div class="mt-4 text-3xl font-black">What are we getting for it?</div><p class="mt-3 leading-6 text-[#7a6167]">Housing, homelessness, crime, transit and data gaps.</p></a>
        <a href="/data/decisions" class="rounded-[2rem] bg-white p-7 text-[#3a1a22] shadow-xl transition hover:-translate-y-1 md:p-9"><div class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#651024]">04 · Council</div><div class="mt-4 text-3xl font-black">What decisions mattered?</div><p class="mt-3 leading-6 text-[#7a6167]">Split votes, major dollars and Strong Mayor Powers.</p></a>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3 text-sm font-bold">
        <a href="/data" class="rounded-full border border-white/25 px-5 py-3 text-white">Five-minute overview</a>
        <a href="/data#advanced-tools" class="rounded-full border border-white/25 px-5 py-3 text-white">Full data tools</a>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-9 text-center text-sm font-semibold text-white/55">AJ Shearer · A Practical Voice for Monaghan Ward · vote.ajshearer.com</div>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
